          "orig": "These terrain features are raised areas that models can be set up on top of or end a move on top of, provided the model's base does not overhang the terrain feature (if the model does not have a base, no part of that model that would be in contact with the battlefield at ground level can overhang that terrain feature). In addition, other terrain features can be set up on top of a Hill terrain feature, provided no part of those terrain features overhangs that Hill terrain feature.",
